        CP1 -- A Library of Procedures for use in the Psion Series 3 range
Calculator.
        Copyright (c) 1996 James Wilkinson
    
    The distribution contains the following files:
README.1ST (this file)
CALC.OPL   (the source code)
CALC.WRD   (the documentation)
MANUAL.WRD (more documentation)
CALC.TXT   (ASCII documentation)
    
    The documentation was written on a Series 3a in WRD format, and uses
many of Word's special features that cannot be reproduced in ASCII. I
therefore recommend that you read CALC.WRD and MANUAL.WRD in preference
to CALC.TXT.
    
    I hope you find the procedures useful,
    James Wilkinson.
